course: dictionary
lesson: 12463
title: Defined: clear and exact
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Defined means clear, or having an exact meaning. «The edge of the table was clearly defined.» You can see exactly where the table stops. When a word or rule is defined, someone has said exactly what it means.
explain: «Define» is the verb: to say exactly what something means, or to show its limits. «Our teacher defined the word “area” before we started.» «Defined» is the past form, so the meaning was already explained.
explain: In maths, a value is defined if it follows the rules. «Dividing by zero is not defined.» It has no answer under the rules, so we call it undefined. Look at the clues: words like «not» or «un-» often mean the opposite of clear.
fact: Defined can be an adjective, as in «a well-defined edge», which means an edge that is clear to see.
fact: «Defined» can also mean having its meaning stated exactly, as in «a defined term».
fact: The verb «define» means to say exactly what something means, so «defined» is its past form.
fact: In maths, «undefined» means a value has no meaning under the rules, like dividing by zero.
fact: A good check is to swap in «clear» or «exact» and see if the sentence still makes sense.
exercise: «The lines on the map were clearly defined.» What does defined mean here? | *Clear and easy to see | Hidden under paint | Very wet | Taken away
exercise: Maths: «Dividing by zero is not defined.» What does this tell you? | It is always one | *It has no value under the rules | It is the biggest number | It equals zero
exercise: «Our teacher defined the word “sphere” for us.» What did the teacher do? | Hid the word from the class | Drew a sphere on the board | Forgot the word | *Said exactly what the word means
test: «The shape had well-defined corners and straight sides.» Which word is closest in meaning to defined here? | Bent | Soft | *Clear | Hidden
test: Which form of define is used in «The rule was defined in simple words»? | Defining | Define | Defines | *Defined
exam: «Dividing by zero is undefined.» What does undefined mean here? | Exactly one | *Has no value under the rules | Clear and exact | Very large
